I'm running NetHack 3.09 on a Unix system.  For some reason, when I started
playing one game today, the movement was going really slow.  Everything else
responded instantly, but my movement would go one step at a time, every 5
or 10 seconds.  Then when I quit, my game was the only one in the top 100
list!  All of my previous scores were gone!  Does anyone know what could have
possibly caused A) My scores to have been deleted, or B) The movement of my
game to slow down?

